<title>USA: Mobil Corp Q4 net eased on charges.</title>
<headline>Mobil Corp Q4 net eased on charges.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFAX, Va. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.68		    $1.93</p>
<p> Net			676,000		  775,000</p>
<p> Revs		  23,236,000		   20,257</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 393,900		  394,600</p>
<p>		     Year</p>
<p> Shr			  $7.38		    $5.87</p>
<p> Net		    2,964,000		2,376,000</p>
<p> Revs		  80,782,000	     75,370,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 394,100		  395,400</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: First Call Q4 consensus was $1.97/shr.</p>
<p>Net excluding special items was $879 million, or $2.20/shr, vs $760 million, or $1.89/shr, in qtr and $3.10 bln, or $7.72/shr, vs $2.85 bln, or $7.06/shr, in year.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
